    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Our beginning</span>
      <h2>Born in Gadwal, made for its fields</h2>
      <p class="lead">We started AGREXA because farmers here constantly faced the same three problems: exaggerated claims on the label, dosages nobody explained, and no one to call when a spray failed. So we built a company around the opposite of those — labels you can trust, math you can verify and a phone number that a real agronomist answers.</p>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:14px">Today our portfolio spans more than thirty crop protection products across four families — insecticides, herbicides, fungicides and biopesticides — serving rice, cotton, chilli, groundnut, maize, jowar, red gram, vegetables and orchards across Telangana and Andhra Pradesh.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" style="min-height:320px"><img src="/site/hero.svg" alt="AGREXA field support" loading="lazy" width="640" height="480"></div>
  </div>
</section>
