<section class="section tint">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Mission &amp; values</span>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:30px">Three promises that shape every decision</h2>
    <div class="split" style="align-items:start">
      <div>
        <div class="value-pill"><div class="v-icon">🎯</div><div><h3>Effective &amp; safe by the label</h3><p>Mission: deliver effective, safe and eco-friendly plant protection. Every dosage, PPE note and pre-harvest interval is printed plainly — in English, Telugu and Hindi.</p></div></div>
        <div class="value-pill"><div class="v-icon">🧪</div><div><h3>Innovation that reaches the field</h3><p>New formulations, biological alternates and resistance-management rotations are tested in local plots before we ever sell them.</p></div></div>
        <div class="value-pill"><div class="v-icon">🌱</div><div><h3>Environmental responsibility</h3><p>Lower-chemical IPM first, biopesticides built into every crop guide, and clear disposal instructions to keep water bodies clean.</p></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="callout">
        <h3>Certifications &amp; partnerships</h3>
        <p style="margin-bottom:14px;font-size:.93rem;color:var(--ink-2)">We publish only what we legally hold — registration numbers appear on every label and pack:</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
