          <li>Manufacturing partners with ISO-grade quality systems</li>
          <li>Collaborations for field trials with agricultural universities &amp; KVKs</li>
          <li>Dealer network trained on safe storage &amp; handling</li>
          <li>Seasonal farmer workshops with the local agri-extension teams</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
